hi this is preshtalwalker in this video  i'm going to teach you how you can  remember the nine times table on your  fingers  to begin place your two hands in front  of you  and think about numbering the fingers  from one to ten starting with your left  hand  let's do an example of seven times nine  count over to the seventh finger which  is the index finger on your right hand  and bend that finger  to do the calculation we count the  number of fingers to the left of the  bent finger and to the right  there are six fingers to the left of the  bent finger and there are three fingers  to the right  seven times nine is therefore sixty  three  this is a great trick and will in fact  show you how you can do this for all of  the times tables from one to ten  for one times nine  we'll bend the first finger on our left  hand  now we count the number of fingers there  are zero fingers to the left of the bent  finger and nine fingers to the right so  one times nine is nine  for two times nine we bend the second  finger  there's one finger to the left and eight  fingers to the right to make eighteen  three times nine we bend the third  finger  we have two to the left and seven on the  right to make twenty seven  four times nine we'll have three on the  left six on the right to make 36  five times nine will have four  and five to make forty five  six times nine  has five and four  to make fifty four  seven times nine  is six and three  sixty-three  eight times nine  will be seven and two  seventy-two  nine times nine  is eight  one eighty one  and finally nine times ten we'll have  nine fingers to the left and zero  fingers to the right to make ninety  so we've done the entire nines tables  using just our hands and counting the  number of fingers so now you'll never  forget your nines table  i hope you like this video please  subscribe to my channel i make videos on  math and game theory you can get my  books on math there's a link in the  video description you can catch me on my  blog mind your decisions which you can  follow on facebook google plus and  patreon you can also catch me on a bunch  of social media sites thanks for  watching  you
 

